1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
away the darkness!
and kick aw

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:25,521 --> 00:01:28,086
I am waiting for you...

20
00:01:30,130 --> 00:01:31,652
Momonosuke!

21
00:01:33,696 --> 00:01:37,522
I await your orders!

22
00:01:39,521 --> 00:01:43,260
I have come here...

23
00:01:45,043 --> 00:01:50,216
...to do battle at your side!

24
00:01:51,826 --> 00:01:55,347
I spoke briefly with
Zunesha before this.

25
00:01:55,782 --> 00:02:00,086
Incredible, Momonosuke-kun!
So you can converse with the elephant!

26
00:02:00,913 --> 00:02:03,174
Just as Oden predicted!

27
00:02:03,869 --> 00:02:08,565
You shall be the one to lead
the world unto a new Dawn!

28
00:02:09,957 --> 00:02:13,087
Alas, we are missing
the most vital part to this...

29
00:02:15,478 --> 00:02:20,608
By reading Father's journal, I understand
that I must live, no matter what.

30
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:22,521
And yet, he...

31
00:02:23,391 --> 00:02:26,521
...tore out the
most important page himself!

32
00:02:30,086 --> 00:02:31,173
Laugh Tale...

33
00:02:31,869 --> 00:02:33,739
...the final island!

34
00:02:35,652 --> 00:02:40,304
What did Roger, Father, and their crew
see there that made them laugh?

35
00:02:45,696 --> 00:02:48,478
I do not understand
the import of what I must achieve!

36
00:02:49,826 --> 00:02:51,869
Father was no prophet!

37
00:02:52,913 --> 00:02:58,174
Were he here now, would he still say
"Open our borders" as he once did?!

38
00:02:59,652 --> 00:03:02,304
I hardly consider myself wise!

39
00:03:03,260 --> 00:03:06,477
If doing so were to put
the people of Wano in danger,

40
00:03:06,478 --> 00:03:08,826
I would not want to open the borders!

41
00:03:11,086 --> 00:03:13,129
Does this make me a coward,

42
00:03:13,217 --> 00:03:14,304
Yamato?!

43
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,696
Carrot, head inside the dome!

44
00:03:26,696 --> 00:03:31,913
We got our revenge!
But the battle's far from done!

45
00:03:31,913 --> 00:03:33,304
Yes, sir!

46
00:03:33,304 --> 00:03:35,956
Stay sharp...
Gotta stay sharp!

47
00:03:35,957 --> 00:03:39,000
151
Who the heck knows when
this'll all come crashin' down...

48
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,174
This island gonna make it through?

49
00:03:42,174 --> 00:03:44,913
I'm not lettin' fall!
ya

50
00:03:45,521 --> 00:03:49,304
Got all beat up, as usual....

51
00:03:50,086 --> 00:03:53,434
I'm pullin' ya up right now!

52
00:03:54,130 --> 00:03:57,000
Hey! You're still breathin', right...

53
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,609
...Zoro?!

54
00:03:59,913 --> 00:04:02,739
You didn't die on me, did ya?!

55
00:04:03,174 --> 00:04:05,608
Zoro!

56
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,783
I won't let you die!

57
00:04:09,826 --> 00:04:11,695
Stay with me!

58
00:04:11,696 --> 00:04:15,826
Oh, crap... Crap! The castle looks like
it could collapse at any moment!

59
00:04:16,521 --> 00:04:19,086
Where's the exit...?
Hamlet!

60
00:04:19,086 --> 00:04:21,260
You can count on me,
my good man!

61
00:04:21,347 --> 00:04:23,912
That's why I'm asking!
Make it your job!

62
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,826
Lives! Important!
Safe delivery!

63
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,086
Ow, hot, ow, hot, owhot!

64
00:04:38,086 --> 00:04:39,651
Oww! Ouch!
'Tis hot, hot! 'Tis not!

65
00:04:39,739 --> 00:04:42,869
Nay, 'tis... not hot! It's hot!

66
00:04:50,347 --> 00:04:54,564
Even we ninja ought to enjoy
freedom in this day and age,

67
00:04:54,565 --> 00:04:55,478
Fukurokuju!

68
00:04:57,304 --> 00:05:00,912
Castle Interior, Third Floor,
Battle of the Connecting Passage...

69
00:05:01,739 --> 00:05:03,174
The victor:

70
00:05:03,174 --> 00:05:04,913
Raizo of the Mist!

71
00:05:11,043 --> 00:05:12,869
Hey! Are you a samurai?!

72
00:05:12,869 --> 00:05:14,956
Why aren't you running?!

73
00:05:18,043 --> 00:05:21,216
You... are one of Luffy-dono's...

74
00:05:24,565 --> 00:05:25,956
I must make haste!

75
00:05:25,957 --> 00:05:29,086
You're in no state to do that!
Relax, now!

76
00:05:29,086 --> 00:05:33,216
A shame...
I was fully prepared...

77
00:05:33,217 --> 00:05:35,304
Hey, now!
Are you that eager to die?!

78
00:05:35,347 --> 00:05:37,086
I would ask a favor!

79
00:05:59,174 --> 00:06:00,130
Finger Pistol!

80
00:06:16,565 --> 00:06:17,347
Shaving!

81
00:06:21,391 --> 00:06:22,652
Finger Pistol!

82
00:06:32,565 --> 00:06:33,391
Finger Pistol!

83
00:06:46,608 --> 00:06:47,608
You must live...!

84
00:06:50,782 --> 00:06:51,652
Kiku!

85
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,435
Damn!

86
00:07:06,782 --> 00:07:08,391
Maha!

87
00:07:08,869 --> 00:07:11,434
Damn you, Izo!

88
00:07:12,869 --> 00:07:15,956
He planned to take us down
with him from the start...!

89
00:07:16,435 --> 00:07:17,608
Damn it...

90
00:07:17,608 --> 00:07:20,738
Why would some vestige of
Whitebeard's crew bother saving brats?!

91
00:07:21,347 --> 00:07:23,217
Have to hurry and
find Nico Robin...!

92
00:07:23,217 --> 00:07:25,130
Ring, ring, ring...

93
00:07:25,174 --> 00:07:27,695
What now?! One damned
thing after another...

94
00:07:27,696 --> 00:07:28,609
Clik.

95
00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:30,869
Listen closely.

96
00:07:31,826 --> 00:07:33,912
An Imperial Edict from
the Five Celestial Elders.

97
00:07:35,435 --> 00:07:36,956
The Five Celestial Elders?

98
00:07:37,435 --> 00:07:39,000
They declare...

99
00:07:40,174 --> 00:07:42,608
"Eliminate Straw Hat Luffy at once"!

100
00:07:43,869 --> 00:07:45,912
What are you telling me to do?!

101
00:07:45,913 --> 00:07:48,739
Straw Hat is fighting
Kaido right now!

102
00:07:49,739 --> 00:07:52,565
Are you telling me to
intervene in Kaido's fight?!

103
00:07:52,565 --> 00:07:53,608
That's impossible!

104
00:07:53,608 --> 00:07:56,565
They are well aware of the
impossible nature of the task.

105
00:07:58,043 --> 00:08:02,173
It's a world-class battle,
which is why it presents a great risk.

106
00:08:02,869 --> 00:08:04,347
Guess why that is.

107
00:08:04,347 --> 00:08:07,477
The order is a necessary precaution.

108
00:08:09,391 --> 00:08:12,739
A precaution against something
even the Five Celestial Elders are wary of...

109
00:08:13,347 --> 00:08:17,434
Something we hardly know of
through rumors and guesswork.

110
00:08:17,435 --> 00:08:18,391
Clik.

111
00:08:21,217 --> 00:08:24,652
can't die without
having done anything!

112
00:08:27,043 --> 00:08:28,825
What's so damned special...

113
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:34,565
...about that pirate crew?

114
00:08:39,739 --> 00:08:42,174
Hihimaru...
Komachiyo...

115
00:08:42,174 --> 00:08:45,174
Both of yas did great!

116
00:08:50,217 --> 00:08:52,652
Boss!

117
00:08:52,652 --> 00:08:53,956
Captain!

118
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,869
We beat Big Mom!

119
00:08:58,869 --> 00:09:01,956
This is a huge deal!
Really huge!

120
00:09:02,739 --> 00:09:08,174
You don't think Big Mom's
gonna come back after all that, do you...?

121
00:09:08,174 --> 00:09:10,913
Mama!

122
00:09:12,957 --> 00:09:14,782
Now hold on, Zeus!

123
00:09:14,782 --> 00:09:18,565
Who's more important to you,
Big Mom or me?!

124
00:09:19,217 --> 00:09:21,608
You, Nami!
You are!

125
00:09:25,391 --> 00:09:28,347
Master! You must stay close to me!

126
00:09:28,347 --> 00:09:30,521
Best keep on your toes
'til it's all over.

127
00:09:31,347 --> 00:09:33,564
Right now, we're on...

128
00:09:34,217 --> 00:09:37,000
...the most dangerous island
in the world, yessir!

129
00:09:38,696 --> 00:09:42,261
Luffy... Are you still fighting?

130
00:09:54,217 --> 00:09:56,304
Damn! Damn!

131
00:09:56,304 --> 00:09:57,521
Damn it all!!!

132
00:09:58,478 --> 00:10:01,391
How long is he going
to make me wait?!

133
00:10:01,391 --> 00:10:04,608
Oh, Komurasaki!
Don't worry!

134
00:10:04,608 --> 00:10:07,478
We'll make our way
out of here soon!

135
00:10:08,435 --> 00:10:10,391
Fukurokuju!

136
00:10:10,478 --> 00:10:15,130
That damned worthless ninja!
What could he possibly be doing?!

137
00:10:15,130 --> 00:10:19,000
He couldn't have escaped
on his own, could he?!

138
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,826
Ninja have no freedom!

139
00:10:20,826 --> 00:10:23,999
They are to live while
their lord does, and die alone!

140
00:10:26,957 --> 00:10:30,696
Was that tremor earlier
Kanjuro's doing?

141
00:10:30,696 --> 00:10:33,087
Hope that was the end of it...

142
00:10:48,957 --> 00:10:51,000
H-Hey!

143
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,435
Komurasaki!

144
00:10:53,086 --> 00:10:57,173
Why do you perform
at a time like this!!

145
00:10:59,304 --> 00:11:01,260
That's enough!

146
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:03,130
Stop your performance!

147
00:11:03,130 --> 00:11:08,826
This is a life-or-death situation,
and you're here, all pretentious and in a mask!

148
00:11:14,696 --> 00:11:17,261
In fact, you've been
wearing it all along...

149
00:11:17,739 --> 00:11:20,304
That mask...
Remove it at once!

150
00:11:28,391 --> 00:11:29,826
Are you...

151
00:11:30,521 --> 00:11:32,173
...truly...

152
00:11:32,174 --> 00:11:34,347
...Komurasaki?

153
00:11:36,130 --> 00:11:38,130
Are you a ghost?!

154
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,609
Did you notice?
Did you?!

155
00:12:48,043 --> 00:12:50,216
Now they've gone and done it...

156
00:12:50,217 --> 00:12:53,000
Those damn idiots...!

157
00:12:57,696 --> 00:13:03,217
They got Linlin!

158
00:13:05,347 --> 00:13:08,434
Jaggy and Traf did it?
Awesome!

159
00:13:13,435 --> 00:13:15,217
You think we should ready up...

160
00:13:15,217 --> 00:13:17,087
...for Kaido?

161
00:13:18,608 --> 00:13:20,782
Nah, it's whatever.

162
00:13:23,826 --> 00:13:26,304
If the one we see
coming down here is Kaido...

163
00:13:31,043 --> 00:13:32,912
I don't have...

164
00:13:34,347 --> 00:13:37,999
...the energy left to fight back...

165
00:13:46,913 --> 00:13:48,739
You there, boy!

166
00:13:48,739 --> 00:13:51,348
Got a mouth?

167
00:13:52,304 --> 00:13:53,782
Hello?

168
00:13:55,174 --> 00:13:57,608
Do you talk or not?

169
00:14:02,521 --> 00:14:04,738
How old are ya?

170
00:14:06,521 --> 00:14:08,695
Fifteen?!

171
00:14:08,696 --> 00:14:09,913
So young!

172
00:14:10,347 --> 00:14:15,434
First time joining Rocks' crew?

173
00:14:15,782 --> 00:14:18,043
He's a good-for-nothin'!

174
00:14:19,347 --> 00:14:21,564
Don't trust him.

175
00:14:21,565 --> 00:14:24,825
If you got a problem,
you talk to me.

176
00:14:28,304 --> 00:14:30,390
I'm Linlin!

177
00:14:31,347 --> 00:14:34,695
I'm the woman who's
gonna rule the seas!

178
00:14:35,608 --> 00:14:37,260
Nice t'meetcha!

179
00:14:41,043 --> 00:14:43,216
Thinking about it now...

180
00:14:43,696 --> 00:14:46,956
...we went way back, you and I...!

181
00:14:47,521 --> 00:14:49,478
You damn hag!

182
00:14:49,826 --> 00:14:53,217
I can't believe this happened...

183
00:14:57,782 --> 00:15:00,739
...right as we vowed...

184
00:15:01,565 --> 00:15:04,912
...to go take the One Piece!

185
00:15:09,652 --> 00:15:11,217
Gear 4:

186
00:15:30,521 --> 00:15:32,086
Snakeman!

187
00:15:32,913 --> 00:15:34,391
DIANEMAN

188
00:15:34,391 --> 00:15:36,608
Shaddap!

189
00:15:36,608 --> 00:15:41,999
I'm in the middle of
reminiscin' here!

190
00:15:42,782 --> 00:15:45,478
I... I can't move...!

191
00:15:47,739 --> 00:15:49,652
I can't free myself!

192
00:15:50,652 --> 00:15:52,652
You were so beside yourself...

193
00:15:53,521 --> 00:15:57,434
So much so that
you failed to take notice.

194
00:15:57,435 --> 00:16:00,565
Come now, Komurasaki!
Why are you just watching!!

195
00:16:00,565 --> 00:16:03,521
Remove this rubble from me at once!

196
00:16:04,347 --> 00:16:05,434
Damn it!

197
00:16:05,739 --> 00:16:09,043
Why is it I can't transform?

198
00:16:09,043 --> 00:16:10,521
So as to...

199
00:16:11,782 --> 00:16:14,521
...prevent you from
transforming into a monster,

200
00:16:15,130 --> 00:16:18,043
you were pierced with
a nail of Sea Stone...

201
00:16:18,957 --> 00:16:21,000
by none other than I.

202
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,217
Why did...?!

203
00:16:23,217 --> 00:16:25,086
What is this I'm hearing from you!!

204
00:16:25,086 --> 00:16:29,695
I thought you loved me!

205
00:16:29,696 --> 00:16:32,739
Love...? Absurd, coming from you.

206
00:16:33,435 --> 00:16:35,826
I bear no love toward you.

207
00:16:37,478 --> 00:16:38,913
Eh?!

208
00:16:39,782 --> 00:16:43,869
By curious coincidence,
your favorite piece...

209
00:16:44,565 --> 00:16:46,130
"Moon Princess"...

210
00:16:47,739 --> 00:16:50,391
You have improved, Hiyori!

211
00:16:50,391 --> 00:16:52,391
I've taken a liking to that song!

212
00:16:52,391 --> 00:16:55,348
Really?! 'Tis called "Moon Princess!

213
00:16:55,869 --> 00:16:57,869
I will improve even more!

214
00:17:01,521 --> 00:17:05,478
What a beautiful song!
Play it at my funeral!

215
00:17:11,217 --> 00:17:14,478
Now, Momo!
Do not make your sister cry!

216
00:17:14,478 --> 00:17:16,565
'Twas your doing, Father!

217
00:17:17,957 --> 00:17:19,696
Was it what I said earlier?

218
00:17:19,696 --> 00:17:22,000
Ah, sorry. 'Twas in jest!

219
00:17:23,304 --> 00:17:24,347
Really?!

220
00:17:26,478 --> 00:17:28,652
I won't be dying!

221
00:17:33,086 --> 00:17:35,043
'Tis the very piece...

222
00:17:36,913 --> 00:17:41,609
...my father, Kozuki Oden, loved.

223
00:17:43,130 --> 00:17:45,478
Every time I perform
"Moon Princess"...

224
00:17:46,652 --> 00:17:48,826
I recall my father's face...

225
00:17:53,391 --> 00:17:55,608
"Father"?!

226
00:17:56,174 --> 00:17:57,782
How could I...

227
00:17:58,913 --> 00:18:00,043
...ever...

228
00:18:01,174 --> 00:18:02,739
...bear to smile...

229
00:18:05,608 --> 00:18:07,608
...in front of you?!

230
00:18:09,826 --> 00:18:12,130
Gum-Gum...

231
00:18:12,130 --> 00:18:13,478
...Hydra!

232
00:18:30,869 --> 00:18:33,912
I dun care 'bout
whatever goal you guys had!

233
00:18:34,608 --> 00:18:38,651
Especially if it leaves
the guys here in this country...

234
00:18:38,652 --> 00:18:41,391
...with no food to eat!

235
00:18:42,086 --> 00:18:45,912
This's my last Gear 4!

236
00:18:46,478 --> 00:18:50,652
The punchin' ain't stoppin'
'til I'm outta steam!

237
00:18:56,347 --> 00:18:59,782
I've got no freakin' clue where
his punches are coming from!

238
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:10,695
I'm gonna...

239
00:19:10,696 --> 00:19:12,174
...kick you outta Wano,

240
00:19:12,174 --> 00:19:16,652
if it's the last thing I do!